    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IBF301 · Materials</span>\n<h2>Books & materials</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Buy or borrow the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed. Materials with no author/ISBN are internal FPT files (download them inside FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IBF301 · Tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Sách & tài liệu</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Mua/mượn đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng. Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN là tệp nội bộ của FPT (tải trong FLM).</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>International Financial Management</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Cheol S. Eun and Bruce G. Resnick · McGraw-hill/Irwin · 2020 · 9th · ISBN <code>9781260013870</code></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>PowerPoint Slides</strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Instructor's Resource Manual</strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Test bank (Test gen and Doc. file)</strong></p><p></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>International Financial Management</strong></p><p>Jeff Madura · Cengage Learning · 2018 · 13th</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>The Economist, Financial Times, Global Finance, etc</strong></p><p>Suggested link:<br><br>(1) The Economist: <a href=\"https://www.economist.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.economist.com</a><br><br>(2) Financial Times: <a href=\"https://www.ft.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.ft.com/</a><br><br>(3) Global Finance: <a href=\"https://www.gfmag.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.gfmag.com/</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>International Financial Management</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Cheol S. Eun and Bruce G. Resnick · McGraw-hill/Irwin · 2018 · 8th</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>ISE International Financial Management</strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Cheol S. Eun and Bruce G. Resnick · Mc Grawhill · 2020 · 9th · ISBN <code>ISBN: 9781260575316</code></p><p>Chọn một trong 3 ấn bản. Ưu tiên mua ấn bản mới nhất.</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>AI in office<br><br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/copy-of-generative-ai-essentials-for-educators/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/copy-of-generative-ai-essentials-for-educators/</a></strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Coursera - FPT</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>Ethics of Artificial Intelligence <a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/learn/ethics-of-artificial-intelligence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/learn/ethics-of-artificial-intelligence</a></strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Coursera</p></div>\n<div class=\"callout\"><p><strong>AI foundations for everyone<br><br><a href=\"https://www.coursera.org/specializations/ai-foundations-for-everyone#courses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://www.coursera.org/specializations/ai-foundations-for-everyone#courses</a></strong> — <em>main · chính</em></p><p>Coursera</p></div>"
